WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.420
The Solo Ship, which had fled to the Crystal Star...

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.820
was suddenly attacked by Abadede of the Buff Clan.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.090
He utilized giant insects called Bajins in his strategy.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.760
The attack severly damaged the Ideon and Solo Ship.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:44.470
However, because of a single Bajin thrown by the furious Cosmo,

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:48.570
Abadede went down along with his Dogg Mack.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:52.440
The Solo Ship once again escaped to space.

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:56.590
They are now under pursuit by Karala's sister Harulu,

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.080
who is about to meet with Gije's squad.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:12.020
<b>Pursuit to the Planet of Ruins</b>

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.070
We've reached the point of contact with Lady Harulu.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:25.860
Are you prepared?

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.240
The transmitter will last for a while longer.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.830
The enemy won't get away...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.780
Although that alone won't gain us Lady Harulu's forgiveness.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:38.220
Are you taking all the blame for this?

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.840
It was me who let Sir Abadede die.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.440
What's going to become of me then?

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.430
I came here to help you get ahead.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.490
You can raise your status if you make up to Lady Harulu.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.870
There is no future for my career.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.360
You shouldn't be so pessimistic.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.720
The Dorowa Zan is exiting subspace.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.310
They've entered the planned course.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.280
Okay!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.510
Prepare for contact!

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.240
We're going to meet with Lady Harulu!

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.380
It's nothing but ruins,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.440
there's no life at all.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.960
It's better that way.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.980
If there were people, we could be mistaken for invaders.

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:43.250
We're running away, yet we are the invaders?

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.690
No way!

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.570
He's been crying all morning...

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.850
Deck! Fard! Help me out!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:06.710
I don't have time for field work! I'm busy!

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.060
Fard! You go!

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.380
I'm lonely...

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.250
Huh?

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.040
There's nothing but holes and rocks out here.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.390
We need to have Sheryl examine these photographs.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:30.950
The missile control system's going to be fixed, right?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:31.530
Yeah.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.710
I don't need photos of the entire ruins!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.130
I want something that resembles writing...

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.910
so I can analyze the 6th civilization's language.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:48.120
This is the best I can manage with the Ideo-Delta.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.520
If you want them so bad, then go get them yourself.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.560
We're not trained for scientific research.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:04.370
Are you still troubled?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.170
Gije, are you still troubled?

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.070
No...

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.290
That's good.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.410
Then I shall find a suitable girl for you.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.850
Thank you very much.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.660
I'm going to lend you the Giro Zan.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:20.350
You are to return to Logo Dau,

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.980
and continue your search for the Ide.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.050
Yes.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.860
Would you care for a drink?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.640
There's no need for that.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.460
Yes ma'am!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.760
In any case, I want to see the aliens.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.950
I need to determine if it's worth sending out my army.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.730
That decision is yours to make, Lady Harulu,

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.060
not mine.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.040
Abadede's results were too disappointing.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.760
And Gije is held back by the assumption that they possess the power of Ide...

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.780
The Giant's battle strength has been described as overwhelming...

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.580
I'll determine that myself.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.970
Yes ma'am! I apologize.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.310
Escort me.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.290
Yes ma'am!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:04.460
Lady Harulu, you should take caution.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.650
The enemy is not as weak as it appears.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.500
Standby for subspace navigation!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.720
Target, Logo Dau!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.590
Is the Anti-Matter engine completely under control?

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:34.360
Yes.

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:38.730
The sixth civilization were more
 advanced than us, weren't they?

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:39.510
Yeah.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.400
It seems to be related to the Legend of Ide.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.690
Ms. Karala.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:45.670
Please tell me about the scientific proof for the Ide.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.150
I only know that-

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.040
What is the meaning of this?

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.740
Why would you bring an enemy to a place like this?

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.820
We were asking her about the Ide.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.470
Leave the analysis of Ideon to me.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:59.590
There has been a giant crater on Planet Buff since ancient times, as if left by a meteor.

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:04.150
We searched in the direction we believe it came from, and found Logo Dau.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:08.590
It must have come from near the planet you call Solo.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:12.690
Is the fruit of Ide represented as some type of food?

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.380
No,

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:17.300
it has been described as a glowing sphere, or a second sun.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:23.940
Also, it's been told that when the hero couldn't protect the Ide from evil,

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.910
he was burned to death as punishment and everything went dark.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:30.850
And the Ide's radiance turned into a star?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.830
Such a depressing fairy tale.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.690
I can acknowledge its significance as a myth, but...

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:39.140
I can tell about it in more detail,

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.640
for everyone's sake.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.240
Don't you mean for Bes' sake?

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.110
Sheryl,

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.260
you're going too far!

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.390
Hey, deck crew!

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.650
You should pick up the stuff you've dropped!

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.770
If it's sucked into the engine, there could be an accident!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.410
Pick it up yourself! We're busy here!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.210
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:05.350
This place is full of stuff I don't understand.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.270
What are you doing?

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.420
Send out a warning!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.940
Unknown small craft flying nearby!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.290
Anti-air, stay alert!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:19.650
<i>Unknown small craft flying nearby!</i>

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:18.900
Where?

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:20.030
A small craft?

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.120
<i>Anti-air, stay alert!</i>

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.770
Incoming!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.180
What's this?!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:45.950
Hey Bes,

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.540
what do you think that is?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.440
You idiot!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.980
You can't use a knife at this short of a distance!

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:51.880
Why shouldn't I?!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:55.660
If it had exploded in front of you, you could have died.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.530
I know what this is,

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.610
it's a remote control reconnaissance plane.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.400
Does it belong to the Buff Clan?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.240
Yes.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.740
Isn't that weird?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.700
That's right.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.480
They shouldn't be able to use it from a far distance.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.860
Then they're chasing us again?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:11.970
Yes.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:13.130
That's odd.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.360
That's right!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.410
The aliens weren't chasing us when we landed on this planet.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.690
Isn't that right, Bes?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.960
What are you trying to say?

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:23.260
It's that alien woman.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:27.580
Are you sure she's not contacting her companions somehow?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.580
Shouldn't you search her entire body?

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:33.150
I was searched first when I was imprisoned.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.500
Right, Ms. Sheryl?

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.640
That's true.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:42.460
These fights are just going continue as long as we have a spy on board.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.100
Cosmo's onto something.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:48.380
Karala's advice helps us stand up to the enemy in battle.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:51.320
You trust her just because of that?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:55.770
I want to get along with everyone.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:58.700
But, the enemy does seem to be acting differently this time.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.700
Why are they sending spy planes now?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.960
Maybe they're not familiar with this planet.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:07.870
It's odd for the enemy to scout us out so closely.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.870
Tracking us from orbit should be enough for them.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.630
Could it be my sister Harulu?

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:20.880
I've learned plenty from this.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:24.440
They seem to be quite an aggressive race.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.220
It seems that way.

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.890
What should we do, Guhaba?

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:33.490
Judging from the fact that they haven't 
discovered the transmitter Gije planted,

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.160
they can't be extremely intelligent.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.320
We'll have Damido lead the attack.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.050
I'll follow in the prototype
Heavy Mobile Mecha, Zigg Mack.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:44.650
You'll be fighting under Guhaba's command.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:46.370
You should be proud, Damido.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.170
Yes ma'am!

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.070
At your service.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.910
This is an enemy I haven't encountered before.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.100
Lure them out for me.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.600
Will you be heading forward, Lady Harulu?

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.960
I want to see it with my own eyes.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.370
Sir Guhaba and Lady Harulu...

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.310
We can't afford to lose, Biras.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:19.970
Yes sir!

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:24.280
This is my last chance to ascend above Gije.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:30.280
Yes, but I hear that Sir Guhaba is
skilled and keeps the credit to himself.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.020
We only need to outsmart him.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:37.190
Such a strange planet. Isn't there a single soul here?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.380
We've found it! The alien ship!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.910
Okay, land!

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.660
Let Damido take lead!

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.370
Don't send out the Zurow Jick!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.270
We need it to protect Lady Harulu!

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:58.550
The Giant machine isn't here?

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:17.900
The Giant is coming from above!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.470
Biras, continue surveillance!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:19.840
Yes sir!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.490
It's doesn't look like the Giant is here. Is there anything on the radar?

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.230
There's a lot of interference. What about you?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.960
Why isn't it coming out?

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.030
What about Lady Harulu?

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.200
Tell her to wait.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.120
There's only one enemy warship.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.740
Launch the Zurow Jick.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.810
It's better to finish them off at once and focus on the search for Ide.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.250
Yes ma'am!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.210
What?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.980
Why is the Zurow Jick there?!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.800
It was Lady Harulu's order!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:05.840
That's careless!

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.970
It's not my fault if the Solo Ship gets destroyed!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.190
Look at the amount of enemies!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.960
The Solo Ship can protect itself!

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:20.330
If we destroy their main ship, they can't attack the Solo Ship anymore!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.270
The enemy's in our proximity, to the upper left, at 11 o'clock!

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.370
Anti-aircraft artillery!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:26.770
What?
Anti-aircraft artillery!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.990
Anti-air surveillance! What's going on?!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:34.780
Did we get them?!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:43.890
It's not enough!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.590
One more time!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.890
This is what happens when you have no defense!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.230
Lady Harulu?!

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.010
That Zurow Jick!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:55.020
It's their fault for heading out!

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.970
They've given up on the Solo Ship!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.550
Cosmo! Kasha!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.480
Roger!

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.650
Go down!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.080
Got it!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.340
Zurow Jick, go protect Lady Harulu!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.230
I'll take care of the attack!

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:26.430
Damn it!

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:30.800
Just for once, she should let us handle the attack without interference!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.170
Give me a damage report on the Solo Ship!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.770
Raise the normal engine's power!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.110
Enemy ship in front!

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.450
Commence attack!

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:42.350
Bes!

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:43.610
It's be better to not fight them.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.550
Why?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.780
If the Gataman Zan has headed out, they aren't going to hold back.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.920
I see.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.670
Also, watch out for that advanced fighter craft, the Zurow Jick.

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.060
The Zurow Jick?

00:14:58.140 --> 00:14:59.130
Is it powerful?

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.260
A new model.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.920
We're getting blasted from the front!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:04.670
Stop!

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:05.870
They're trying to bait us!

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.340
I knew we couldn't trust this woman!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.220
Let's attack!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.270
Retreat!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.010
Have the Solo Ship retreat immediately!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.280
Do you trust her?

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.260
Mr. Joliver!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.980
My own sister is attacking this ship.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:20.850
If it's come to this, I share my fate with all of you.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.880
Your sister's on that ship?

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.390
They're escaping? Damn aliens!

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:34.260
Gataman Zan, fall back!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.910
Zurow Jick, attack!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.000
Hurry!

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.410
Lou!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.280
We've lost three machines?

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:50.910
Biras!

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:51.800
Can we catch up with the enemy?!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.650
Lady Harulu is chasing the enemy ship!

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.280
We were ordered to defeat the Giant!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:04.270
Smoke missiles?!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.160
It's the docking sign!

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:09.580
Align the machines for docking!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:10.330
Okay!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.530
Transform and then dock!

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:30.990
Tell Lady Harulu not to go too far in!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:31.640
Yes sir!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:32.720
Oh! What's that!?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.450
What?!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.740
Is that a different enemy?

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:36.840
No, it isn't!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.060
A giant?!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.940
It turned into a giant?!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:59.240
I see, this is what I've been hearing about. We'll definitely need the Zigg Mack.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.450
Kasha! Take care of the small fry!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.300
The Ideon will handle that huge one ahead!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.350
Roger!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.280
They're too far away!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.090
It's way bigger than anything we've faced before!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.100
Be careful!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.230
I know!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:18.450
It doesn't look too impressive.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:21.200
You're no match against the Zigg Mack's power!

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:28.230
He dodged it?

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.660
Kasha! Moera!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.420
Concentrate your attack on the right!

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.740
Turn 90 degrees!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.020
Lady Harulu!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.490
The Giant has appeared!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.340
Good!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.980
I want to see the Giant!

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.890
Turn 120 degrees!

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.630
Where did the Giant come from?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:56.240
I didn't get to see the three parts combine into the Giant...

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.680
This is absurd!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.780
We shouldn't barge in when Sir Guhaba is fighting!

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.370
Lady Harulu is watching.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:09.570
We only need to get near the Giant and fire the hooks.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.560
Let's aim for the eye.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.480
Sir Damido!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.370
I must prove my worth to Lady Harulu!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:20.850
I can't bring shame to my family name!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:22.460
11th Missile Block!

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.200
Fire to the back left!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.350
Let's punch those fools! Charge!

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:31.510
The upper left!

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.040
What?!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.130
Hooks!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.280
Activate the high electromagnetic current!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.120
Yes sir!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.980
Have the following two units attack too!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:55.940
It's working!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:01.600
The controls aren't working well!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.100
They're coming from the upper left!

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.040
Again?

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:05.810
You won't defeat us!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:14.060
Don't get in my way!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.150
Now!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.050
Damn Giant!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.470
Go!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.470
The Giant punched them?

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.610
Just like a human being!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.130
Damn Giant!

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.780
It's just a robot!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.420
Zigg Mack, Gil Baus, retreat!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.120
I can't bear to watch this.

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.450
The lever wire broke?!

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:54.620
Cosmo! We can't go!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.790
We need to fix the Ideon's exterior!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.760
Are we letting them get away?

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.730
Damn it!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:08.430
If we're always returning to a
 defensive state, we'll never win!

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:26.380
That's right.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:30.220
We had to lure them with the Solo Ship and take them down at once.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:35.070
Anyway, you did well considering we haven't faced that kind of enemy before.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:38.310
We were about to finish them off. Let's attack again.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.270
I agree.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:40.460
That's careless.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.920
My sister wouldn't have come here
with such a small number of soldiers.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.680
Can we trust her?

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.640
She's a Buff Clan woman.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.360
Ms. Sheryl?

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.730
I'm not a strategist, but...

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:55.550
I don't believe it. That's all the enemy has got.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:00.190
How do those fighting feel about it?

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.360
I trust her.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:05.690
I think they enemy sent out new troops today just to patrol us.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.870
I feel that way too.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.390
So do I.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:11.170
What about you, Sheryl?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.640
I think we can trust Karala Ajiba for now...

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.780
but that doesn't mean I trust everything you say.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.310
Yes, but let me thank you nevertheless.

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:38.560
Ah, Sir Damido!

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:41.830
H-how are my wounds?

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:44.270
You'll be alright. It's only a light wound.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.200
Seems that way.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.470
What about Lady Harulu?

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:50.890
She admits that it was a mistake sending out the Zurow Jick.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:52.010
I see.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:57.860
It's preposterous that my life is being ruined by the Giant...

00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.380
I must keep together!

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.650
We'll continue fighting once the Zigg Mack has been repaired.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:05.850
What do you think about the Giant's power?

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:12.060
Based on what I saw, it's a formidable
opponent that moves with great speed.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.470
I'll leave it to you.

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:16.360
Yes ma'am!

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:24.070
It seems the aliens call their robot Ideon...

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:28.780
That word sounds too much like Ide.

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:34.950
The energy that will rule the entire universe...

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:56.520
<i>Karala, who is suspected to be spy, makes
the decision to meet her sister Harulu.</i>

00:22:56.520 --> 00:23:00.700
<i>However, Karala is humiliated by her own sister.</i>

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:04.900
<i>Having witnessed that, Bes rushes into the middle of enemy territory.</i>

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:09.020
<i>Can Cosmo save the two?</i>

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Breaking Through the Enemy Front"</i>

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:17.580
<b>Breaking Through the Enemy Front</b>

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:17.100
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

